    "description": {
      "type": "String",
      "label": "Description",
      "value": "<p>Your wily opponent manages to hook his weapon around your leg and slashes open the back of your thigh, lacerating the muscles and tendons above the back of the knee.</p><p><strong>Effects:</strong> You suffer a @UUID[Compendium.wfrp4e-core.items.Item.nF5z1OEhpi4t6a6S]{Torn Muscle (Minor)} and must pass a <strong>Challenging (+0) Athletics</strong> Test or go @Condition[Prone].</p>"
